"K1881103028" "Gutter Information Officer"
"K3932071482" "This elevator goes to the North Ward of the Gutter. <t=8> Quarantine is in effect for all citizens that may have come in contact with Arachnoids. <t=8> The Arachnoid threat has exploded down there.  Do NOT interfere with Arachnos efforts to contain this outbreak.<t=8> Should you choose to travel down into the North Ward of the Gutter, be warned that Arachnos will not be held responsible for lost items or limbs."
"K4029300929" "Down this elevator is the North Ward of the Gutter. <t=8>Do not interfere with Arachnos extermination operations underway in the Gutter. <t=8> Watch for Arachnoids. Contamination will not be tolerated. <t=8> It's rough down there. You are advised to not venture in alone."
"K4214886019" "Behind me is the elevator to the North section of the old city.  <t=8> Do not interfere with the Arachnoid Contamination Abatement squads in full effect down below. <t=8> Minimize your contact with the hapless citizens that live below.  Any one of them may have Arachnoid contamination."
"K4286116047" "Use this elevator, {VillainName}.  It will take you on down to the Gutter, North Ward. This Section is under lockdown due to the increased Arachnoid activity. Recluse is advising aginst single eplorers.  It's tough down there -- bring some backup."
